# lsTrace

- _lsTrace(input)_

Answer a stream that is equal to _input_ but prints each value as it is acquired.

```
>>> lsTrace(lsSeries(1, 1, 9)).upToEnd
[1 .. 9]
```

* * *

See also: lsCollect

